<title>BELARUS: Belarus Jan-July trade deficit grows to $923.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan-July trade deficit grows to $923.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus posted a trade deficit of $923.1 million in the first seven months of this year after a $461.8 million deficit in the same period of 1995, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>    BELARUS MERCHANDISE TRADE   Jan-July96 Jan-June96 Jan-July95</p>
<p>    exports ($ billion)	     3.004	2.549	2.480</p>
<p>    imports ($ billion)	     3.927	3.420	2.942</p>
<p>    trade balance ($ million)  -923.1     -871.5     -461.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Trade with Russia accounted for $464.5 million of the deficit in the first seven months of this year.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229-2264</p>
</text>
